We believe that each group represents a cancer subtype + TME (tumor microenvironment).
Please analyze each group and clustering.
Choose the simplest and most informative one.

Then, perform a deeper analysis for each group, classifying the cancer subtypes
At the end, try to identify the lncRNAs and miRNAs according to possible functions.

